WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.020
 How far are we from a slash goal in codecs to make a proper software, and it's going

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:11.140
 to work in one day instead of three months?

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:17.860
 I think you need to have it first set up for the planning, then do checks with external

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.900
 AIs, checking each other, putting the feedback into a goal, and when that's done, put a goal

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.160
 on the build, a goal on the test.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.160
 So you have different steps and use maybe a big goal to check multiple goals.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:30.840
 Then it's possible.

